{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Star Ores Inc.</strong>\u2014where ore, robots, and the drive for money determine your success! Your career begins on an abandoned space station in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroid Mining</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your laser drill to extract ores from the asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/2025-05-2313-47-32-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749212008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Automation by Robots</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy robots to help you mine, transport, and sell ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/Cavescene_03-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749212008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sell Ore and Maximize Your Profit</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell ore to intergalactic customers and strike it rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/2025-05-2313-41-48-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1749212008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Space Station</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The old station hides secrets! Remove growths, discover new areas, activate old terminals, and upgrade your laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/2025-05-2313-44-17-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1749212008\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your laser, bring the space station back to life, and become a legend of intergalactic mining. <strong>Your career begins NOW!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613270?t=1749212008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/64d8fd16ba5727c6859481fb16b561fc7bcc374a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749212008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/817120040c7d78f07b4cb3436c23838d0dceabec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749212008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/817120040c7d78f07b4cb3436c23838d0dceabec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749212008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Star Ores Inc.</strong>\u2014where ore, robots, and the drive for money determine your success! Your career begins on an abandoned space station in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroid Mining</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your laser drill to extract ores from the asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613270/extras/2025-05-2313-47-32-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1749212